{"overview":"زِیم آرزوهای بزرگی دارد. متأسفانه، او در نقش تهاجم‌کننده‌ی فضایی کاملاً بی‌کفایت است. در تلاش برای خلاص شدن از زِیم مزاحم، رهبران سیاره‌اش او را برای نفوذ به زمین می‌فرستند و تجهیزات تکه‌تکه‌ای می‌دهند. به تعجبشان، زِیم موفق می‌شود پایه‌ای بر روی زمین بنا کند و به‌عنوان کودک انسانی در فرهنگ بشری نفوذ کند، در حالی که نقشه‌ی سقوط سیاره را می‌کشد. تنها دشمن اصلی زِیم، دیب، می‌داند که زِیم بیگانه است، و البته هیچ‌کس ادعاهای دیب را باور نمی‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Zim dreams of greatness. Unfortunately, though, he's hopelessly inept as a space invader. Desperate to be rid of the annoying Zim, his planet's leaders send him on a mission to infiltrate Earth, providing him with leftover, cobbled-together equipment. To their consternation, Zim succeeds in setting up a base on Earth and infiltrating human culture, posing as a human child as he plots the planet's downfall. Only Zim's archnemesis, Dib, recognizes that Zim is an alien, and of course, nobody believes Dib's claims.","tagline_en":"Bow down and prepare for DOOM!","runtime":11,"status":"Canceled","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":6,"y":2000,"poster":"/hVZ1esIZrSxjQbQ8xd3IZjFwLkC.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":36,"y":2001,"poster":"/1Hrz6h7eiZ1BONIgCjqcZTuqHfI.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2002,"poster":"/hOoQWUiaiz16ukGcOazaaDjeghV.jpg"}],"episodes":46,"crew":["Jhonen Vasquez"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Richard Steven Horvitz","role":"Zim (voice)","photo":"/pyL1MykCkuKTAp23PmmD6T8HVbn.jpg"},{"name":"Andy Berman","role":"Dib (voice)","photo":"/9n7h50lDhZCXwiYqbviLit9uLP5.jpg"},{"name":"Rosearik Rikki Simons","role":"GIR (voice)","photo":"/3qjyVQWhgGXwayd7KtrbipnmWFp.jpg"},{"name":"Melissa Fahn","role":"Gaz (voice)","photo":"/frSDBlw7X4FPSLgJfhrecrSpafI.jpg"},{"name":"Lucille Bliss","role":"Ms. Bitters (voice)","photo":"/4PE7Fm9Jzl5Klcnfbm8qjfer1lo.jpg"},{"name":"Rodger Bumpass","role":"Professor Membrane (voice)","photo":"/lGQkw6adxqB6Hcm7VK8nVHbKupe.jpg"}